body.rn:
Muri Luka 14:25-33, Yesu ahamagara ukwitanga kwuzuye. Ashaka kuba:
- **Umwami w'ubucuti bwacu**: aja imbere y'umuntu wese, n'umuryango nyene (umurongo 26);
- **Umwami w'ubutunzi bwacu** (umurongo 33);
- **Umwami w'ubugingo bwacu bwose**: kwikorera umusaraba no kumukurikira (umurongo 27).

> Abgira bose, at'Umuntu ni yagomba kunkurikira, ni yiyanke, yikorere umusaraba wiwe uko bukeye, ankurikire.
> — Luka 9:23

> Ivyo ni vyo Data yubahirizwamwo, ni mwama vyinshi, kandi muzoba abigishwa banje.
> — Yohana 15:8

Ubugingo bw'umwigishwa buhimbaza Imana. Mu ncamake, umwigishwa:
- **yiga** kuri Yesu ubuzima bwiwe bwose;
- **agenda asa** n'Umwami, umwigisha wacu;
- **akunda** Imana n'abandi;
- **yitanga** kuri Yesu nk'Umwami wa vyose;
- **arondera** ubwami bw'Imana imbere;
- **yama ivyamwa** bihimbaza Data.
